# Notice

This plugin is a port of ntfy-opencode 0.1.2 by Alex Haines.

Upstream: https://www.npmjs.com/package/ntfy-opencode
License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Alex Haines

The event classification, permission and question gate, per-location rule,
process-wide dedupe, and the rule that notification text carries no session
content come from that package. Its ADRs are kept in `adr/0001` to `0011`.

Changes in this port:

- TypeScript source and tests.
- OpenCode Effect plugin entry point.
- Config from `~/.config/opencode/ntfy.json` with `{env:VAR}` substitution.
- Hold before send, cancelled when the prompt is answered.
- Quiet hours.
- A `notify` tool for agent-initiated pings and delayed reminders.
